WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:22.240
We finally arrived at the final venue, Alcatraz.

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:27.840
Surrounded by debris, will Battle City end atop the Duel Tower?

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:32.160
Jonouchi.  Kaiba.  Marik.  And me.

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:37.080
To determine the semifinal matchups, we started a battle royal.

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:43.180
I can determine my opponent if I want to, so how should I battle?

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:49.190
Battle Royal!

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.650
How dare you, Yugi!

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:07.640
You're helping Jonouchi?

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.880
Thanks, Yugi.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:18.920
To duel Jonouchi in the semifinals, I must first lower Kaiba and Marik's life points to 0.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:24.220
That's why I can't let you eliminate Jonouchi's life points, Kaiba.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:28.850
Yugi, you're my rival.  The one I must defeat.

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:32.920
Winning that battle is my destiny.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.200
And most of all...

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:37.540
My Obelisk.

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:43.720
And your Slifer.

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:50.440
I need both to stand a chance against his God Card, The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:57.120
Yugi, in order to win Battle City and gain the title as the true Duel King...

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:01.060
...I'll force you to duel me in the semifinals.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:05.660
Yugi, thank you.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:11.940
It's clear that you want to duel me in the semifinals to fulfill our promise.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:16.180
Yugi, I want to duel you too.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:17.740
But...

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:22.310
I have to defeat him to wake Mai up.

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:40.680
Mai is waiting for me to save her.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.830
I see.

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:47.130
A weakling needs Yugi to protect him.

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:48.440
Say what!

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:52.110
You're a pitiful, ordinary duelist anyway.

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:54.980
Try saying that again!

00:03:55.200 --> 00:04:00.650
It's sweet that you two friends want to fulfill your promise to duel.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:03.650
But think, Jonouchi.

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:07.090
Why does Yugi have to help you?

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:09.960
I'll tell you why.

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:13.460
Because the semifinals is your only chance to duel each other.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:14.400
What?

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:22.070
Jonouchi, no matter who you face next, you won't make the finals!

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:24.550
You don't have the skills.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:29.500
And your three opponents have God Cards.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:37.500
Yugi knows that the semifinals is his only chance to duel you.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:42.530
And that you're the easiest way to get through the semifinals.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:43.400
What?

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:50.150
I can't believe you're rigging the match during the Battle City Finals.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:54.500
Kaiba!  Enough with your insults!

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:56.200
Insults?

00:04:56.200 --> 00:05:04.680
If you want to disprove me, then have your friendly game during the finals.

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:05.660
Kaiba!

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:06.800
Yugi!  Enough!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.100
Jonouchi.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:11.820
Thanks for helping me.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:14.620
But I fight with my own free will!

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:17.480
I don't care what Kaiba says.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:19.300
Let's meet in the finals, Yugi!

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:20.770
Jonouchi...

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.920
Thanks, Kaiba.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.440
You helped make up my mind.

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:31.000
I'll let this loser dog whine.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:35.150
Yugi, duel me in the semifinals!

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:36.280
Kaiba!

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:52.160
Mai, be strong.

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:59.070
Hey!  Watch out!

00:05:59.510 --> 00:06:00.970
I'm sorry.

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:03.110
Sorry, but we're in a hurry!

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.680
Shizuka, let's go!

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:05.880
Jonouchi is waiting!

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:08.600
Jonouchi?  Wait a sec!

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.980
You know Jonouchi?

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:14.240
This is his sister.

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.980
The Ghouls are chasing us.

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:19.420
Ghouls?  Hop on!

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:29.030
When my eyes heal, the first thing I want to see is my brother duel.

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:34.200
I'm surprised Jonouchi has a sister who cares so much about him.

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:36.520
He'll be fine.

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:38.440
He's a good guy.

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:41.380
He's nice and courageous.

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:47.050
Even during Duelist Kingdom, he risked his life for you.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:53.500
Wnen you remove your bandages, I'm sure he'll live up to your expectations.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:54.720
Mai!

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:57.730
I might be overpraising him.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:05.840
My brother is fighting hard because he believes that you'll wake up.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:08.040
So please wake up.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:11.770
And cheer for him, Mai!

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:20.800
The final tournament has started.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.420
Yes...  Back then...

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:29.360
You're...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.360
Sister...

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:33.760
Rishido!

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:35.660
Marik!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.230
Save Rishido from him!

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:43.440
I heeded Marik's warning and moved Rishido to another room.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:47.050
But I haven't heard from Marik since.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:50.750
Has his soul vanished?

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:55.920
Or has his dark side completely overtaken him?

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:01.900
Rishido, the tragedy started when you collapsed.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:33.000
The next day, Marik and Rishido were gone.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.090
Along with the Millennium Rod.

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:41.740
That tragedy ended our family's duty... or so it seemed.

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:04.350
Millennium Necklace, you say that tragedy is only starting?

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:13.000
Marik stole The Winged Dragon of Ra and Slifer the Sky Dragon from the Valley of the Kings.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:52.820
The Obelisk card isn't here.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.940
Long time no see, Sister.

00:09:56.940 --> 00:10:00.180
Is it coincidence that we meet here?

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:02.180
Marik!  Ghouls!

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:03.110
Give up!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:07.650
This is pointless, Sister.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:19.530
How did you get a job here?

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:26.600
Anyway, only a gravekeeper can guard the stone tablet and God Cards.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:30.270
Marik!  Return Ra and Slifer!

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.730
They belong to me.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:35.080
Along with this Millennium Rod.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:38.700
No.  They belong to the nameless Pharaoh.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:41.450
Give them back to their rightful owner!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:45.280
Sister, did you forget about our tragedy-

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:50.570
No, the nameless Pharaoh is the cause of tragedy for all gravekeepers!

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:53.460
I'll find him and get our revenge!

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:55.300
Stop, Marik!

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.260
Destiny is determined.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:00.840
Your actions will cause a new tragedy!

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:02.200
Silence!

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:07.340
The carvings on my back!

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:09.650
The scars on Rishido's face!

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:15.620
Did we suffer pain just to help the nameless Pharaoh?

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.940
I won't accept that!

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.220
Marik...

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:26.310
Sister, I used the Millennium Rod to create the Ghouls.

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:31.480
With this power, I'll kill the nameless Pharaoh and become the Pharaoh myself.

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:34.070
And change the gravekeepers' destiny!

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:38.650
When that time comes, I'll come for you.

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:42.010
Let's live together, like we three used to.

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:44.910
Marik, you can't escape.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:11:59.960
Rishido?

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:06.900
Sister, I will get Obelisk.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.130
Rishido...

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:21.110
You're the only one who can stop the other Marik from awakening.

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:25.830
That's why you chose to stay with Marik forever.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:37.830
Rishido, since you're unconscious, his evil soul took over his body.

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:41.430
Everything is due to destiny.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:45.910
The boy named Yugi building the Millennium Puzzle.

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:52.310
Pegasus finding the stone tablet in Egypt and creating Duel Monsters.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:57.250
Seto Kaiba acquiring a God Card.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:00.300
Nameless Pharaoh...

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:04.590
Marik and our future...

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:18.800
...depends on you.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.090
C'mon c'mon!

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.300
Continue the duel already!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:46.230
Sealed memories...  Gravekeepers...

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:49.240
All these things make me hate you.

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:51.670
My target for the semifinals is...

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:53.610
You, Yugi.

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:56.030
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:56.030 --> 00:14:00.050
But I'll get rid of those two fools first.

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:02.600
I set a card!

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:06.130
And I summon Lord Poison in attack position!

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:10.420
Next, I switch Newdoria to attack position!

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:12.600
Kaiba, prepare yourself.

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:15.860
I'll end you and Yugi's flunky quickly.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:19.560
Newdoria attacks Kaiba's Vorse Raider!

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:27.480
What?  His monster has fewer attack points.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:28.540
Interesting.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:32.450
Marik's monster must have an effect!

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:35.120
Strike back, Vorse Raider!

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.110
Newdoria is destroyed!

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:43.680
Its effect activates!

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:49.630
When this monster is destroyed in battle, I can destroy one monster on the field!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.530
I choose...

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:54.680
Vorse Raider!

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:01.810
Nice!  Now Kaiba's field is empty!

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:05.750
I took 700 points of damage this turn.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:09.680
But I activate this spell card from my hand.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.340
Spell of Pain!

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:16.860
It transfers his damage to another player.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.790
I'll use its effect on...

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.970
...Jonouchi!

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:23.500
What?

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:28.160
Your pod will rise equal to the life points you lost.

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:33.840
Jonouchi!

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:35.780
Jonouchi!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:39.710
Damn!  I'm the closest to the top!

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:43.260
Stay calm!  You only lost 700 life points!

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:46.300
You're still fine!  Plenty of time to turn this around!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:47.850
So you say, but...

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:50.300
I don't have a monster on my field.

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:51.990
I'm in bad shape!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:59.170
As planned, I destroyed Kaiba's monster and deal damage to that flunky.

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:04.880
Next turn, I'll tribute this monster to summon another monster.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.380
I end my turn!

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:07.710
My turn!

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:11.680
There are no monsters on Kaiba's field.

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.060
I'll take him down!

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:16.350
I tribute Big Shield Gardna!

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:21.920
I summon Archfiend of Gilfer!

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:23.580
Here I go, Kaiba!

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:26.770
Bring it, Yugi!

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:28.530
Gilfer Flame!

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:32.270
Big brother!

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:33.760
Not good enough, Yugi!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.460
I expected that move!

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:37.340
I activate my trap!

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:39.270
Attack Guidance Armor!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:44.460
It redirects attacks to the monster wearing this cursed armor!

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.150
That card changes the attack target.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:53.090
Yugi, I can use this card on Archfiend of Gilfer, but should I?

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:54.600
Gulp!

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:58.360
Actually, I don't have a monster that can wear that armor.

00:16:58.360 --> 00:16:59.020
Lucky!

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:04.150
Your monster will wear this cursed armor!

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.100
Marik!

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:10.440
Take Archfiend of Gilfer's attack!

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:13.960
Oh well.

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:18.230
I activate the trap card, Mirror Force!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:20.310
Mirror Force?

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:25.990
Archfiend of Gilfer's attack is negated and destroyed!

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:27.520
Are you sure?

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.760
I activate my Counter Trap!

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:32.730
Seven Tools of the Bandit!

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:38.260
It negates your Mirror Force's activation and destroys it.

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:39.640
What?

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.780
This is intense!

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:55.980
Marik!  You lost life points in that attack!

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:58.650
So your pod rises!

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:04.390
My and Marik's life points are equal.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.620
Don't forget, Yugi.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:12.980
Seven Tools of the Bandit costs 1000 life points to use.

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:15.000
So you're going up too.

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:16.460
I know.

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:18.340
What?

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:23.960
Now Yugi is the highest.

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:27.050
I get it.  He doesn't have to win this battle royal.

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:31.120
He can also select his opponent by losing.

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:35.720
Yugi!  You really want to duel that scrub?

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:36.620
My turn!

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:41.060
I don't have a monster in my hand.

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:42.990
Please!  Let me get one!

00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:44.480
I draw!

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:46.870
All right!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.870
I summon Gearfried the Iron Knight!

00:18:50.300 --> 00:18:51.760
In attack position!

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.480
He finally summoned a monster.

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:57.120
Go, Jonouchi!

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:59.580
Who should I attack?

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:04.750
Kaiba and Marik used up their set cards on Yugi's turn.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:09.840
And they don't have monsters to defend with, so they're wide open.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.120
Which one should I attack?

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:13.060
Well...

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:15.010
I already know my target!

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:16.560
Here I go, Kaiba!

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:18.530
I attack you directly!

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.970
Kaiba can't protect himself.

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:26.910
Take this, Kaiba!

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:32.180
Big brother!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.450
All right!

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:39.220
How dare a scrub hurt me!

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:44.020
Kaiba!  You're going to reach the top as a loser dog!

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:47.960
Now Marik and Jonouchi's pods are at the bottom.

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:52.200
Jonouchi attacked Kaiba instead of Marik...

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.180
Can it be?

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:56.840
He wants to fight Marik?

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:08.350
Mai can die at any time.

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.580
I will defeat Marik in the semifinals!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:15.920
I set a card and end my turn!

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:17.860
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:26.230
If I attack Yugi and destroy myself, I'm in position to duel Yugi in the semifinals.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:30.700
But I don't want to lose before the finals!

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:33.850
I set three cards!

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:37.450
I summon Blade Knight in attack position!

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:40.560
I'll deal with that scrub later.

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:43.010
I'll attack... Marik!

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:47.470
Blade Knight, attack Marik directly!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.200
Blade Attack!

00:20:58.740 --> 00:21:02.700
Damn!  It's less likely that I'll duel Marik!

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.140
Marik is now higher than the others.

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:08.140
Who do they actually want to duel?

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:12.080
I refuse to lose on my road of battle.

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:17.450
I will defeat the scrub and Marik.

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:20.380
And defeat Yugi in the semifinals.

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:26.490
Yugi, let's show them the battle between our gods!

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:53.730
Since they all have different goals, I don't know how the battle royal will end.

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:57.820
Marik and Kaiba's attacks put Jonouchi in a pinch.

00:21:57.820 --> 00:22:01.800
While Yugi can't attack, Jonouchi suddenly talks to him.

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:06.830
"What's a true duelist?"  What's on your mind?

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:09.760
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Each Player's Opponent

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:11.380
Duel, standby!

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:23.790
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:32.740
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:33.070 --> 00:22:37.710
The straight rail and harsh route

